**Request \[[Create API Key](https://ultracart.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ucdoc/pages/38688545/API+Simple+Key)\]**
```bash
curl -X POST "https://secure.ultracart.com/rest/v2/customer/customers/1901934/adjust_cashback_balance" \
  -H "Accept: application/json" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8" \
  -H "X-UltraCart-Api-Version: 2017-03-01" \
  -H "x-ultracart-simple-key: 9ba531f25214860199e2f539c3800100992dc2bbaeb40d0199e2f539c3800100" \
  -d $'{
    "description": "Adjusting customer cashback balance because they called and complained about product.",
    "expiration_days": 365,
    "vesting_days": 45,
    "adjustment_amount": 59.0,
    "order_id": "DEMO-12345"
}'
```

**Response Headers**
```html
Status: 200 OK
X-UltraCart-Request-Id: 41625152EBFB1A0199E31457B880011
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8
Transfer-Encoding: chunked
Date: Tue, 14 Oct 2025 14:16:25 GMT
```

**Response Body**
```json
{
    "adjustment_amount": 59.0,
    "balance_amount": 0.0,
    "success": true,
    "metadata": {}
}
```
